1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,660
How does one wire become a paper clip?

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,850
Pull it straight.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,050
Cut it.

4
00:00:08,197 --> 00:00:09,247
Bend.

5
00:00:10,197 --> 00:00:11,247
Bend again.

6
00:00:12,203 --> 00:00:13,253
Once more.

7
00:00:14,704 --> 00:00:17,514
One wire. Three bends. No glue.

8
00:00:17,884 --> 00:00:20,274
The steel springs back. That's the grip.

9
00:00:20,444 --> 00:00:22,684
Crayon, or rubber band? Comment below.
